        "description": "Positive family history consistent with autosomal dominant inheritance",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of all three major criteria: craniofacial dysmorphism, skeletal abnormalities, and developmental delay",
